The '''Tag Arena Stages''' ( ''タッグ競技場'', ''Taggu Kyōgijō'', '''Tag Stadium''') are a group of [[Timed Score Reward|timed stages]] similar to the [[Duel Stages]]. The first four were added in [[Version 9.7 Update|Version 9.7]], while the fifth was added in [[Version 9.9 Update|Version 9.9]].

This event was replaced by the [[Tag Arena Challenge]] in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]].

==List of Levels==
There are three stages per map, each with a Cat Deploy Limit and enemy limit of 2. Taking over 15 minutes to beat any stage will cause an [[Assassin Bear]] to spawn. As opposed to the Duel Stages, most of the enemies can spawn multiple times.

